# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
config RUST_NSTREE
	bool "Rust namespace tree tracking and listns"
	depends on RUST
	default y
	help
	  Build the namespace tree tracking and listns bodies from kernel/nstree.rs in the
	  original kernel/nstree.o slot, with native companions for configured
	  primitives, storage and metadata. Turning this option off selects
	  the unchanged original C provider.
